---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Bhagyashri Patil | Analytics, BI & Applied AI">
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Data Analytics &nbsp; · &nbsp; Business Intelligence &nbsp; · &nbsp; Applied AI</span><h1><span class="intro">Hi, I'm Bhagyashri.</span>Turning complex data into <em>clear decisions.</em></h1><p>I'm a data and business intelligence professional who transforms complicated problems into actionable insights, intuitive reporting experiences, and reliable analytical solutions.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/projects/">Explore my work ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="/experience/">My experience →</a></div></div><div class="hero-art" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a modern data analytics dashboard"><div class="halo"></div><div class="visual"><div class="visual-header"><span class="dots">● ● ●</span><span>INSIGHT / OVERVIEW</span></div><h3>From signals to stories</h3><div class="metric"><div><small>Analytics perspective</small><strong>Clearer thinking.</strong></div><b>↗</b></div><div class="bars">{[28,46,38,60,52,70,65,84,73,92,82,100].map(n=><span style={`height:${n}%`}></span>)}</div><div class="visual-foot"><span>EXPLORE</span><span>UNDERSTAND</span><span>IMPROVE</span></div></div><div class="float-tag">✦ Data with direction</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">01 / About</span><div><h2>Analytical thinking.<br>Practical impact.</h2><p>I work at the intersection of business context and technical problem-solving. My interests span BI strategy, data modeling, dashboard development, and applied machine learning—all focused on making information genuinely useful.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">02 / Expertise</span><div><h2>What I bring to the table.</h2><p>A combination of hands-on engineering, thoughtful analytics, and communication that makes data accessible to stakeholders.</p></div></div><div class="cards"><article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">01 · Intelligence</span><h3>Business intelligence</h3><p>Dashboards, KPI design, visual storytelling, and decision-ready insights.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">02 · Foundations</span><h3>Data & engineering</h3><p>SQL, data modeling, ETL, and dependable reporting workflows.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">03 · Innovation</span><h3>Applied AI & ML</h3><p>NLP, experimentation, and useful AI-assisted analytics.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">03 / Selected work</span><div><h2>The work behind the insights.</h2><p>Explore projects, research, and the way I approach real-world analytical challenges.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/projects/">Browse projects ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="/research/">Research →</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">04 / Connect</span><div><h2>Let's build something meaningful.</h2><p>Interested in analytics, data products, or applied AI? I'd love to connect.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bhagyashripatil/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/patilbp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(360px,.9fr);gap:clamp(35px,5vw,90px);align-items:center;min-height:710px;padding:clamp(70px,8vw,125px) 0}.hero-copy{min-width:0}.hero h1{max-width:760px}.intro{display:block;font-size:clamp(1.45rem,1.85vw,2rem);font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-bottom:15px}h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#4266da}.hero p{max-width:660px}.hero-art{position:relative;min-height:455px;display:grid;place-items:center}.halo{position:absolute;width:min(97%,510px);aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:40%;transform:rotate(-12deg);background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%,#d9e4ff,transparent 63%),linear-gradient(130deg,#f0f4ff,#e7ecfb)}.visual{position:relative;width:min(90%,495px);border:1px solid #dfe6f3;border-radius:24px;padding:clamp(25px,3vw,38px);background:white;box-shadow:0 30px 75px #263a6621;transform:rotate(2deg)}.visual-header{border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf6;padding-bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#8795a9;letter-spacing:.1em;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800}.dots{color:#b9c8e1;letter-spacing:.15em}.visual h3{margin:22px 0}.metric{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin:20px 0}.metric small{display:block;color:#8692a5;margin-bottom:5px}.metric strong{display:block;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-size:1.28rem}.metric b{color:#4366d9;font-size:2rem}.bars{height:155px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f4;padding-bottom:12px}.bars span{flex:1;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;background:#cbd9f9}.bars span:nth-child(even){background:#8eaaed}.bars span:last-child{background:#4269dc}.visual-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:16px;color:#8a96aa;font-size:.67rem;font-weight:800}.float-tag{position:absolute;bottom:8%;left:0;background:white;padding:13px 17px;border:1px solid #e3e9f3;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 14px 30px #263a6619;font-size:.84rem;font-weight:800;color:#4167ba}
@media(max-width:1120px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:unset;gap:10px}.hero-art{max-width:590px;width:100%;margin:auto}}@media(max-width:600px){.hero{padding:55px 0}.hero-art{min-height:300px}.visual{padding:20px}.bars{height:108px}.float-tag{bottom:0}}
</style>
